AtropOS.svg and AtropOS-dark.svg are the AtropOS crown: five spikes, the
center one tallest, with three triangular cuts. There is no letter, ring,
or wordmark.

Both files use the same royal purple, #5B2C8C. The saved earlier artwork
was gold and silver, so this purple is the royal purple for the icon.
AtropOS-dark.svg is the same drawing. Agama still loads AtropOS.svg, and
AtropOS-dark.svg on the dark scheme.

The crown and the product definition are GPL-2.0-only. They are not
derived from the openSUSE chameleon.
